        },
        {
          "text": " Nisikilizeni, ninyi mjuao haki, watu ambao mioyoni mwenu mna sheria yangu; msiogope masuto ya watu, wala msifadhaike kwa sababu ya dhihaka zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.7",
