                  "text": "20:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ukamsahau BWANA, Muumba wako, yeye aliyezitanda mbingu, na kuiweka misingi ya dunia; nawe unaogopa daima mchana kutwa kwa sababu ya ghadhabu yake yeye aoneaye, hapo ajitayarishapo kuharibu; nayo i wapi ghadhabu yake aoneaye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
